{"id":"1b50e22b5e5cad3f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb7 Separating Family","display":"df-zfc-comb7-separating-family — ZFC Comb7 Separating Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family","58-df-zfc-comb7-point-separating-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb7-separating-family — ZFC Comb7 Separating Family","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-family.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-point-separating-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb7-separating-family — ZFC Comb7 Separating Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-family.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (ambient set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (family of subsets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S\\)</span> (canonical binary predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}point\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;((x\\in A\\land y\\notin A)\\lor(y\\in A\\land x\\notin A))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}point\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;((x\\in A\\land y\\notin A)\\lor(y\\in A\\land x\\notin A))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The point-separating alias denotes this same predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-family.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}point\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(x\\neq y\\to\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;((x\\in A\\land y\\notin A)\\lor(y\\in A\\land x\\notin A))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}separating\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{SeparatingFamily}(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PointSeparatingFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)","display":true}],"bytes":1233,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1698","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family.md|58-df-zfc-comb7-separating-family]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["545b51e7aa011030"]}